apter fails)","strategies":"       Strategy addresses","totalHolding":"     Strategy holdings in USDT terms (1e18)"}},"getRewardManagerSnapshot()":{"details":"- Includes RM.totalHoldings (1e18) and raw ERC20 balances for autoswap tokens         - Decimals are fetched via IERC20Metadata; fallback = 18 on failure","returns":{"balances":"         Balances of each token on RM (native decimals)","decimals":"         Decimals of each token (best-effort)","rm":"               RewardManager address","tokens":"           RewardManager autoswap token list","totalHoldings1e18":"RM total holdings in USDT terms (1e18)","usdtBalance":"      USDT balance on RM (native 1e6)"}},"getRoleAdmin(bytes32)":{"details":"Returns the admin role that controls `role`. See {grantRole} and {revokeRole}. To change a role's admin, use {_setRoleAdmin}."},"getStrategiesRewards()":{"details":"- Gross uses getCVXCRVHoldingsGross()         - Net uses getCVXCRVHoldings()         - Reverts are swallowed per-strategy (returns zeros for that row)","returns":{"crvAmountGross":"CRV amount (gross)","crvAmountNet":"  CRV amount (net)","crvUsdtGross":"  CRV value in USDT (gross, 1e6)","crvUsdtNet":"    CRV value in USDT (net, 1e6)","cvxAmountGross":"CVX amount (gross)","cvxAmountNet":"  CVX amount (net)","cvxUsdtGross":"  CVX value in USDT (gross, 1e6)","cvxUsdtNet":"    CVX value in USDT (net, 1e6)","pids":"          Active DSF pool ids","strategies":"    Strategy addresses"}},"getTokenUsdPrice1e18(address)":{"params":{"token":"Token address"},"returns":{"ok":"True if price is usable","price1e18":"USD price scaled to 1e18","updatedAt":"Price source timestamp"}},"getTokensUsdPrices1e18(address[])":{"params":{"tokens":"Token addresses"},"returns":{"oks":"True if price is usable","prices1e18":"USD prices scaled to 1e18","updatedAts":"Price source timestamps"}},"grantRole(bytes32,address)":{"details":"Grants `role` to `account`. If `account` had not been already granted `role`, emits a {RoleGranted} event. Require